# docs/ 整体忽略，但交接文档要进版本控制（否则回滚/换机器就丢了）
docs/*
!docs/HANDOFF.md
# tests/ 忽略，但回归探针与它的 golden 基线要进版本控制 ——
# 数据模型重构的唯一安全网，不进 git 就没法复现验证
tests/*
!tests/expvis_probe.py
!tests/golden/
# The behavioural tests: the layer the probe has no equivalent of. Same reason
# as the probe — a verification that does not travel with the code is not a
# verification.
!tests/behavior/
!tests/setup/
# node_modules/ is covered by the rule below; this is the dev-only manifest the
# behavioural tests need. The editor itself still ships as index.html +
# js/editor.js with no build step and no runtime dependencies.
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!jest.config.js
node_modules/
.DS_Store
*.docx
*.md
!README.md
!data/rating_rubric_CN.md
!docs/HANDOFF.md
# 这张对照表是 tests/expvis_probe.py coverage 的生成物 —— 结论在探针里,
# 文档只是它的另一种呈现,所以同样要进版本控制。必须写在 *.md 之后。
!docs/JSPsych_TIMELINE_COVERAGE.md
